{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406810/extras/be1a9c80dad824076a2b99ac160bc27b.avif?t=1759251706\" width=900 height=528 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Help three unlikely friends destroy the void\u2014before they destroy </i><strong>each other!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New allies Weapon, Spirit, and Magic have some big tasks ahead of them. Recover their stolen memories, defeat an ancient demon or two, and escape from the dreaded void between worlds... Assuming they can stop arguing, first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406810/extras/3448cd666b05da4572522d3ff327328f.poster.avif?t=1759251706\" width=1170 height=341 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406810/extras/3448cd666b05da4572522d3ff327328f.webm?t=1759251706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-based, but QUICK!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emblems: Sunless Vow </strong><i>is a Roguelite Visual Novel</i> <i>set in a forsaken void where you must\u00a0put your soul on the line to escape.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its turn-based\u00a0battles\u00a0are\u00a0designed to reduce decision-paralysis, allow short bursts of play, and offer an evolving stream of challenges as its story unfolds... Control three types of souls in a type-triangle combat system that rewards calculated risk! Allow or remove RNG with various difficulty settings... Take a Story-Only cruise, or heat things up with up to eight Tribulations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406810/extras/2378e3359a54819c5d8068703bc8eb81.avif?t=1759251706\" width=1528 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mystery + Drama + Comedy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Weapon&quot; and &quot;Magic&quot; remember nothing,</strong> as they wake in an unforgiving void where vengeful souls haunt every corner. A mysterious guide named &quot;Spirit&quot; appears just in time to save them... But doesn't he know a little too much? <i>And just what is with that outfit...?</i> Shenanigans abound in this novella-length drama whose secrets keep you guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406810/extras/fd71c53182c9d2595a913e2e07ed561e.avif?t=1759251706\" width=1528 height=560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But wait! It's a Roguelite too!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take your time with the carefully-balanced maps in Story Mode, and enjoy an emotional tale with a roguelite progression system...\u00a0</i><strong><u>Or take your chances with the ever-shifting void \u2014 in procedurally-generated Chaos Mode!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in the twists and turns of a voidrift, you'll face new enemy tactics, stack over 100 passive Buffs, and utilize special Promotions to give form to your ideal build.\u00a0But be warned: even greater foes lurk in these depths...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406810/extras/fe32bc792ca0ca59abf60b8b969bbf0d.avif?t=1759251706\" width=1528 height=560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Labor of Love, by two developers (plus voices!)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Coder</u> / <u>Composer</u> / <u>Game-Designer</u> - <strong>Ikiru</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Artist</u> / <u>Writer</u> / <u>Animator</u> - <strong>Tonic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only others involved were the wonderful voice-actors for our character barks: Jessie Starborne, Joe Goffeney, Rob Milton, Kendra Woods, and T Ivie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suffice to say, the two of us have worn a lot of hats over the past few years... We are so happy to finally share these hand-painted artworks, dynamic character animations, carefully-crafted battles, and a hauntingly epic soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whether you thrive on tiny math, crave an engaging story with endearing characters, or just enjoy watching numbers go up... We hope you\u2019ll find something to love in our game.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2406810?t=1759251706","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759251706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406810/14d64c0d34903cdf232bfcbb3da38aaf0b62e671/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759251706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406810/14d64c0d34903cdf232bfcbb3da38aaf0b62e671/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759251706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input",