Promotions to give form to your ideal build.\u00a0But be warned: even greater foes lurk in these depths...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406810/extras/fe32bc792ca0ca59abf60b8b969bbf0d.avif?t=1759251706\" width=1528 height=560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Labor of Love, by two developers (plus voices!)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Coder</u> / <u>Composer</u> / <u>Game-Designer</u> - <strong>Ikiru</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Artist</u> / <u>Writer</u> / <u>Animator</u> - <strong>Tonic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only others involved were the wonderful voice-actors for our character barks: Jessie Starborne, Joe Goffeney, Rob Milton, Kendra Woods, and T Ivie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suffice to say, the two of us have worn a lot of hats over the past few years... We are so happy to finally share these hand-painted artworks, dynamic character animations, carefully-crafted battles, and a hauntingly epic soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whether you thrive on tiny math, crave an engaging story with endearing characters, or just enjoy watching numbers go up... We hope you\u2019ll find something to love in our game.</i></p>","developers":["oldflowerGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406810/25afc065903d57a3b95511095c7f055062635c7e/header.jpg?t=1759251706","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 oldflowerGames 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stro