com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406810/c7e97a73b6f4543c1ff040b6a6605b827464b280/ss_c7e97a73b6f4543c1ff040b6a6605b827464b280.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759251706","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406810/c7e97a73b6f4543c1ff040b6a6605b827464b280/ss_c7e97a73b6f4543c1ff040b6a6605b827464b280.600x338.jpg?t=1759251706"}],"short_description":"Can they stop arguing long enough to escape the void?! A Roguelike Visual Novel with QUICK turn-based combat and flexible difficulty. Calculate, power-up, and stack favors to The Heart's content... Or take on a narrative campaign filled with Mystery + Drama + Shenanigans.","steam_appid":2406810,"support_info":{"email":"team@oldflowergames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}